1
00:00:01,420 --> 00:00:02,700
ANNOUNCER:
Guess what, Pin?

2
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:04,460
You've won a Win Token.

3
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:06,080
What is a Win Token?

4
00:00:06,182 --> 00:00:09,177
As you remember, you were
the only one to rip the ribbon.

5
00:00:09,451 --> 00:00:12,430
That means you did better than
the rest of the contestants,

6
00:00:12,430 --> 00:00:14,114
so you win a Win Token.

7
00:00:14,525 --> 00:00:16,160
If you're about to get eliminated,

8
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:19,188
you can use your Win Token
to void half of your votes.

9
00:00:19,611 --> 00:00:21,180
And here's your Win Token.

10
00:00:22,674 --> 00:00:24,777
Now it's time for Cake at Stake.

11
00:00:24,914 --> 00:00:25,660
♪ Da-da-da-da-da-da ♪

12
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:27,508
♪ Cake at Stake! ♪

13
00:00:27,805 --> 00:00:28,971
But first we have to get...

14
00:00:35,405 --> 00:00:37,302
Get into your teams, people.

15
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:39,497
OK, Squashy Grapes.

16
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:42,880
You lost last time, so you do the Cake at Stake.

17
00:00:43,250 --> 00:00:44,125
Sit.

18
00:00:44,171 --> 00:00:46,022
I have nine slices of cake.

19
00:00:46,480 --> 00:00:49,885
If you receive a slice of cake,
you get to stay for another day.

20
00:00:50,022 --> 00:00:51,860
If you don't, you leave the battle.

21
00:00:51,860 --> 00:00:54,685
But don't worry. You'll be treated with TLC.

22
00:00:55,314 --> 00:00:58,022
OK, let's see how many votes we received.

23
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:00,674
Seven votes.

24
00:01:00,948 --> 00:01:03,108
Now it's time to pass out the cake.

25
00:01:03,577 --> 00:01:06,902
Leafy, you got zero votes. Here's your cake.

26
00:01:07,920 --> 00:01:10,285
Needle, you also got zero votes.

27
00:01:10,788 --> 00:01:11,900
Same with Ice Cube,

28
00:01:11,900 --> 00:01:12,490
Rocky,

29
00:01:12,490 --> 00:01:13,170
Teardrop,

30
00:01:13,170 --> 00:01:14,228
and Coiny.

31
00:01:14,525 --> 00:01:17,977
Uh, maybe I should turn down
the throwing speed of the tosser.

32
00:01:18,468 --> 00:01:20,708
Snowball, you're safe at zero, too.

33
00:01:21,291 --> 00:01:23,954
Tennis Ball, you didn't do anything good, but...

34
00:01:24,411 --> 00:01:25,794
you're safe with one vote.

35
00:01:25,954 --> 00:01:28,011
So is "sam!", whoever Sam is.

36
00:01:29,908 --> 00:01:31,260
If you kick me out,

37
00:01:31,260 --> 00:01:34,422
I'll CRUSH you with my Announcer Crusher!

38
00:01:35,085 --> 00:01:36,660
Well, too bad for me,

39
00:01:36,660 --> 00:01:39,017
because Golf Ball is safe at one vote.

40
00:01:39,234 --> 00:01:40,180
- ANNOUNCER: And you, Flower, are out with four votes.

41
00:01:40,180 --> 00:01:42,057
- FLOWER: GRRRRRRRR!
- ANNOUNCER: And you, Flower, are out with four votes.

42
00:01:54,460 --> 00:01:56,651
FLOWER:
WHAAAAAOOWWHAAA!!!!!

43
00:01:57,017 --> 00:01:59,480
Earlier this morning, I was
really afraid of being POPPED,

44
00:01:59,480 --> 00:02:02,331
but now I'm feeling better and
I don't think I'm gonna be popped!

45
00:02:03,862 --> 00:02:04,960
WOO!

46
00:02:04,960 --> 00:02:06,910
Now my chances of winning went up

47
00:02:06,910 --> 00:02:10,660
from 5% to 5.263%!

48
00:02:10,660 --> 00:02:13,490
Wow, GB. I'm impressed.

49
00:02:13,490 --> 00:02:17,040
No arms, and you can still use a calculator!

50
00:02:17,040 --> 00:02:20,000
What made you think I was using a calculator?

51
00:02:20,491 --> 00:02:27,245
♪ [INTRO PLAYS] ♪

52
00:02:27,245 --> 00:02:29,245
Subtitles: Daniel Adam Valle

53
00:02:29,954 --> 00:02:32,548
The second contest is an obstacle course.

54
00:02:33,028 --> 00:02:34,800
You have an hour to complete it.

55
00:02:35,154 --> 00:02:38,970
When you get to the end, you will try
to get as much water into your team tank

56
00:02:38,970 --> 00:02:41,211
as you can in the remaining amount of time.

57
00:02:41,611 --> 00:02:44,891
At the end of the hour,
whichever team has more water wins.

58
00:02:45,302 --> 00:02:49,074
And yes, whoever is the first
to finish the course gets a Win Token.

59
00:02:49,657 --> 00:02:50,660
Wait.

60
00:02:50,660 --> 00:02:54,500
Before that O get onto the screen,
I have to tell you one more thing.

61
00:02:54,500 --> 00:02:56,000
AWWWH.

62
00:02:56,000 --> 00:03:00,297
BOOOOOOOORRRRRRING.

63
00:03:00,445 --> 00:03:03,028
Cherries, you're missing a team member.

64
00:03:03,531 --> 00:03:08,137
If you don't find that team member
in the next hour, your team automatically loses.

65
00:03:08,937 --> 00:03:10,140
BLOCKY!

66
00:03:10,140 --> 00:03:11,840
OK, O, come on over.

67
00:03:17,885 --> 00:03:19,622
Squishy Cherries! Stop!

68
00:03:19,817 --> 00:03:22,788
We have to decide who will find Blocky
and who will run the course.

69
00:03:22,788 --> 00:03:24,780
We'll find Blocky.

70
00:03:24,780 --> 00:03:26,780
PIN:
Spongy, you go too.

71
00:03:26,780 --> 00:03:28,780
And, Pencil, go with them!

72
00:03:28,780 --> 00:03:30,480
But, our alliance!

73
00:03:30,480 --> 00:03:31,820
We have to stick together!

74
00:03:31,820 --> 00:03:34,080
Alliance, shmalliance. Go, GO!

75
00:03:34,491 --> 00:03:36,491
Pencil! We'll wait for you!

76
00:03:39,097 --> 00:03:41,417
Whoa! In first!

77
00:03:42,411 --> 00:03:43,314
WHOA!

78
00:03:43,885 --> 00:03:44,411
Oof!

79
00:03:45,782 --> 00:03:47,245
Oh, great.

80
00:03:50,297 --> 00:03:53,302
OK, so THIS is the fish that ate Blocky.

81
00:03:53,531 --> 00:03:55,474
Now we have to get him out.

82
00:04:01,702 --> 00:04:05,220
Wow, Needle! She's such a fast runner.

83
00:04:05,220 --> 00:04:06,377
That's good!

84
00:04:13,874 --> 00:04:14,640
PBBT!

85
00:04:14,777 --> 00:04:15,725
GRR!

86
00:04:15,965 --> 00:04:16,537
AUGH!

87
00:04:17,405 --> 00:04:20,102
OMQ, what is taking her so long?

88
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:23,977
Be patient. It's only been five minutes or so!

89
00:04:26,708 --> 00:04:28,674
♪ Open mouth, yeah, yeah, yeah! ♪

90
00:04:28,674 --> 00:04:30,670
♪ Let him out, yeah, yeah, yeah! ♪

91
00:04:30,670 --> 00:04:32,540
- BLOCKY: What is she doing?
- PENCIL: ♪ So we can win the contest, ♪

92
00:04:32,540 --> 00:04:32,685
- PEN: Blocky! I thought you got eaten!
- PENCIL: ♪ So we can win the contest, ♪

93
00:04:32,685 --> 00:04:35,320
- PEN: Blocky! I thought you got eaten!
- PENCIL: ♪ so we can win the contest! ♪

94
00:04:35,508 --> 00:04:37,770
No. It tried to eat me,

95
00:04:37,770 --> 00:04:39,874
but it missed me by A BIT!

96
00:04:40,171 --> 00:04:43,588
WAAAAOOOOUUUUGH!

97
00:04:45,650 --> 00:04:47,451
♪ Come on and open that-  ♪

98
00:04:47,862 --> 00:04:48,708
YEAH!

99
00:04:49,874 --> 00:04:50,811
Yikes!

100
00:04:57,565 --> 00:04:58,640
I'm stuck!

101
00:04:58,640 --> 00:05:00,000
Sorry, Pin.

102
00:05:00,765 --> 00:05:03,337
Please don't tell me Woody will have to climb me!

103
00:05:03,840 --> 00:05:06,331
WOODY:
Auuuweuuerrr...

104
00:05:06,685 --> 00:05:07,730
Ehhhhh...

105
00:05:07,730 --> 00:05:09,108
AHHHH!

106
00:05:10,045 --> 00:05:11,268
Jump, Rocky!

107
00:05:13,325 --> 00:05:16,780
TB! What in the spherical world was THAT for?

108
00:05:16,780 --> 00:05:19,200
To prevent a Rocky and Woody collision.

109
00:05:19,200 --> 00:05:20,080
GOLF BALL:
Okay.

110
00:05:21,977 --> 00:05:23,302
TB, Help me!

111
00:05:23,702 --> 00:05:24,457
Thank you!

112
00:05:25,268 --> 00:05:26,742
But now I can't cross!

113
00:05:36,822 --> 00:05:38,331
Aw, seriously?

114
00:05:38,582 --> 00:05:41,020
Thanks for all you're doing for me.

115
00:05:41,020 --> 00:05:42,114
No problem.

116
00:05:48,468 --> 00:05:51,340
HNNNGHHH!

117
00:05:51,340 --> 00:06:01,074
AAAAAAAAAAAHHHHHHH!

118
00:06:13,234 --> 00:06:14,742
NEEDLE:
Aw, seriously?

119
00:06:16,262 --> 00:06:17,702
Well, here we go!

120
00:06:19,942 --> 00:06:21,325
Hey, watch this!

121
00:06:21,645 --> 00:06:24,754
The bowling ball and you
are falling at the SAME RATE!

122
00:06:32,251 --> 00:06:34,502
Need a break from all the stress?

123
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:36,777
Then eat our gumball.

124
00:06:37,142 --> 00:06:40,270
It's only 70,000 payments

125
00:06:40,270 --> 00:06:42,685
of $70,000.

126
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:44,262
Each.

127
00:06:44,811 --> 00:06:47,462
Call now. The number on your screen.

128
00:06:47,874 --> 00:06:49,062
Now.

129
00:06:49,931 --> 00:06:52,080
BLOCKY:
Here's a fun prank you can pull!

130
00:06:52,445 --> 00:06:55,268
Drill a hole into the Bubble Recovery Center,

131
00:06:55,440 --> 00:06:57,290
pour tacks in,

132
00:06:57,290 --> 00:07:00,300
and watch Bubble pop INFINITELY!

133
00:07:00,300 --> 00:07:02,880
HA ha-ha ha-ha! HA ha-ha-ha...

134
00:07:02,880 --> 00:07:05,560
This program was brought to you

135
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:09,474
by Blocky's Funny Doings International.

136
00:07:10,354 --> 00:07:12,194
OMZ!

137
00:07:12,594 --> 00:07:14,182
I killed her!

138
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:15,417
Oh, well.

139
00:07:16,868 --> 00:07:17,828
Easy.

140
00:07:19,268 --> 00:07:23,142
AAAAAAAAHHHHH!

141
00:07:24,171 --> 00:07:26,360
Okay, let's get back now.

142
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:29,154
We have a BUNCH of lost time to make up!

143
00:07:30,045 --> 00:07:30,880
Oh!

144
00:07:32,034 --> 00:07:34,125
OMW. Spongy.

145
00:07:34,125 --> 00:07:36,120
He just makes me wanna HURL.

146
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:39,097
MATCH:
Pencil, you're here!

147
00:07:39,097 --> 00:07:41,090
Now let's go, SUPER FAST!

148
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:46,510
Oh, thank you, you're here!

149
00:07:46,510 --> 00:07:47,810
GET ME OVER THAT WALL!

150
00:07:47,810 --> 00:07:49,142
Over THAT?!

151
00:07:49,782 --> 00:07:51,140
I dunno...

152
00:07:51,140 --> 00:07:52,160
Still stuck!

153
00:07:52,160 --> 00:07:55,028
Arms might be useful right about NOW!

154
00:07:56,308 --> 00:07:57,234
FINALLY!

155
00:08:00,274 --> 00:08:02,491
Huh? NO, WOOOOAH!

156
00:08:04,057 --> 00:08:05,417
MATCH:
And THROW!

157
00:08:09,170 --> 00:08:09,771
PEN:
Oof!

158
00:08:13,302 --> 00:08:15,234
Well, THAT'S convenient!

159
00:08:16,148 --> 00:08:17,428
Hey, Firey!

160
00:08:17,782 --> 00:08:19,657
OW! Grr!

161
00:08:19,954 --> 00:08:20,662
COINY:
Hey!

162
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:25,405
Throw us up!

163
00:08:25,405 --> 00:08:27,400
Yeah, but nah.

164
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:29,800
We're only going for our own team...

165
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:31,005
Spongy.

166
00:08:33,680 --> 00:08:34,491
Yeah!

167
00:08:37,028 --> 00:08:37,805
Uh-oh.

168
00:08:50,091 --> 00:08:50,822
Yeah!

169
00:08:52,434 --> 00:08:55,222
Ugh! ARGH! Come ON!

170
00:09:02,148 --> 00:09:03,074
Help us up!

171
00:09:04,820 --> 00:09:06,811
Golf Ball! Look!

172
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:20,137
Huh? Oh, great, the balls are here.

173
00:09:23,668 --> 00:09:26,697
TD, help me get more ahead of Firey!

174
00:09:26,925 --> 00:09:30,217
Water. It's TOO DANGEROUS to handle!

175
00:09:30,354 --> 00:09:30,982
Uh oh!

176
00:09:31,177 --> 00:09:32,320
I'm stuck!

177
00:09:34,308 --> 00:09:36,880
Heh-heh. Thanks, TB and GB.

178
00:09:36,880 --> 00:09:38,194
MATCH:
We gotta go, Pencil.

179
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:43,977
Oh, no! I've been DULLED!

180
00:09:48,171 --> 00:09:49,500
Spongy!

181
00:09:49,500 --> 00:09:51,520
BUBBLE:
He's just so fat, you know?

182
00:09:52,937 --> 00:09:56,571
AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHHH!!!

183
00:10:01,760 --> 00:10:03,451
Beep. Time's up.

184
00:10:03,977 --> 00:10:05,300
The Squashy Grapes win.

185
00:10:05,300 --> 00:10:05,874
Yeah!

186
00:10:05,874 --> 00:10:07,870
So yeah, choose someone to vote.

187
00:10:22,662 --> 00:10:25,337
So, um, are they gonna pick us up or what?